      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This year [2013], the full moon of Shvat will fall on Shabbat Shira itself, January 24-25. In your own Seder, feel free to integrate the four teachings by reading each passage in its “world.” If you do, please credit The Shalom Center, referring to a treasury of teaching about this festival at https://theshalomcenter.org/treasury/118. Thanks!</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Shalom, Arthur</tei:p>
        <tei:p>[For consistency, I have provided corresponding Hebrew and modified certain transliterations. — Aharon Varady.]</tei:p>
